VERSION: 2

# OpenBlade mhvtl rehearsal rig — library 10 contents.
# 3 drives, 1 picker, 4 I/E (MAP) slots, 8 storage slots.
#
# Barcode trailing characters select the media type (see mhvtl docs):
#   "L8" = LTO-8, "CLN" leading = cleaning cartridge.
#
# OB0001L8..OB0006L8 are data media. OB0007L8/OB0008L8 are the declared
# SCRATCH tapes — the only barcodes handed to OPENBLADE_SCRATCH_BARCODES,
# i.e. the only ones the destructive tests may format.
# CLN001L8 exercises the cleaning-cartridge branch in the parsers.
# Slot 8 is deliberately left EMPTY so inventory has an unoccupied slot.

